{
  "description": "USDT depeg alarm (Android DepegAlarm.kt / iOS DepegAlarm.swift). threshold: stored tenths of a percent -> effective (unknown -> 5). measure (Build 76): Kraken USDT/USD last, Coinbase USDT-USD last and Binance USDC/USDT last (null = missing) -> USDT in USD and viaUsdc, tolerance 1e-9; expected null = no measurement. Rules: any print outside 0.05..3 is an exchange error; inside 0.5..1.5 one source suffices; in the break range (0.05..0.5, 1.5..3) a print counts only if another source agrees within 5 % of the larger value (a single out-of-band print stays implausible, a real crash confirmed by two sources is kept). Both direct sources (Kraken, Coinbase) accepted -> the one closer to 1 (Binance ignored); one direct -> closer to 1 of it and Binance (1 / USDC/USDT); no direct -> Binance alone with viaUsdc true, which never fires the alarm (mayAlarm = !viaUsdc). evaluate: deviation in percent, threshold in percent, armed, mayFire -> fire, armed (re-armed at half the threshold; magnitude rounded to 4 decimals, threshold inclusive). episodes: prices in order (start armed, every fired notification is posted; quiet = mayFire false) -> fired per step. mainExchange: watchlist market keys -> exchange key and URL of the 'Open exchange' button. cardWarning: last reading (price in USD, ageMillis = now - reading time; null price = no reading) and stored thresholdTenths -> shown on the portfolio card (magnitude >= threshold, same rounding as evaluate; hidden when older than 30 minutes or more than 1 minute in the future). cardNote (Build 58; Build 76: optional viaUsdc of the reading, default false): «USDT = 1» line of the portfolio card independent of the alarm — holdings (coin symbols, any case), valuesViaUsdt (values hang on USDT = USD: display currency, USD or mixed exchanges) and the last reading as in cardWarning -> kind DEVIATION (fresh reading >= threshold, as today), PRICE_SOURCE («Prices: Binance · USDT = 1»), USDT_ASSUMED (holdings contain USDT, counted as 1) or null (no line). usdtMarket (default false; owner decision Oct 2026, USDT valued at its market price): a fresh reading (liveUsdtUsd, up to 6 hours old) -> USDT_BREAK when values depend on USDT and the price is outside 0.5..1.5 (confirmed crash, valued at market), else VIA_USDC when values depend on USDT and the reading came from Binance USDC/USDT alone, else no line; otherwise USDT_ASSUMED whenever values depend on USDT (valuesViaUsdt or USDT held) = marker of the 1-fallback, else no line. liveUsdtUsd: last reading -> live USDT/USD for valuation if at most 6 hours old (21600000 ms; up to 60 s in the future; the cardWarning limit of 30 minutes does not apply) and within 0.05..3 (stored readings were checked by measure, so outside 0.5..1.5 only a confirmed crash), else null. usablePrice (Build 96): last price of one source, exchangeAgeMillis = now - exchange time of the ticker (null = exchange sends no time, 0 exchange time = unknown) -> price used for measure, or null when the exchange time is older than 2 h (same rule as price alarms, AlarmFreshness.exchangeTimeTooOld): no measurement stored, no alarm.",
